@startuml deserializeStateMachine
state Uninitialized
state Ready

[*] --> Uninitialized

Uninitialized --> Ready : Init()
Ready --> Uninitialized : DeInit()

Ready --> Ready : Parse() [valid frame]
Ready --> Ready : Parse() [invalid -> returns error status]

note right of Ready
  Stateless parser.
  Each Parse() call is independent.
  No persistent state between calls.
end note
@enduml